          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of the silent passage of a luminous object in the sky; observation of a glow in a basin of the E.Herriot port in Lyon: probable observations of a meteoroid reentry.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "abbda2ddabbd5d000a8da888dbb46a54bb23e6398b261e68c330a799ea6c50b4"
